  "prefLabel": "App 204.01 Date of Issuance or Filing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "App 204.01 Date of Issuance or Filing. All written documents governed by these rules shall be rebuttably presumed to have been issued on the date noted on the document and to have been filed with the council on the actual date of receipt by the council, as evidenced by a date stamp placed on the document by the council in the normal course of business.\n\nSource. #7864-A, eff 4-1-03",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/app100-500.html"
